// Canonical source: an inner class "can only be created if an instance of
// the outer class exists" (thesis line 654); new Inner() at the unit's top
// level has no outer instance, and it is refused.
// Answer: "BML-HATI-UNSUPPORTED class/inner-needs-outer"
class Outer : Object { section [public] { class Inner : Object { section [public] { int V() { return 1; } } } } }
return new Inner().V();
